  "notable_quotes": [
    "ZIF-8 is thermodynamically propane-selective due to stronger binding, but large crystals or high flow can make it propylene-selective under kinetic control.",
    "Dynamic selectivity, Sd(t), is proposed to explain breakthrough behavior by combining thermodynamic and kinetic contributions.",
    "Increasing ZIF-8 crystal size from 9 to 224 μm restricts propane intracrystalline diffusion and reverses preference from propane to propylene."
